sequenceDiagram
    %% Caminho sensor → risco → alerta → entrega no estado atual (ADR-0008 a ADR-0011, verificado em 2026-11-04).
    autonumber
    participant Sensor as Sensor / fonte externa
    participant Ingestion
    participant Kafka
    participant Geospatial
    participant RiskCatalog as Risk Catalog
    participant RiskEvaluation as Risk Evaluation
    participant Orchestrator as Alert Orchestrator
    participant Channels
    participant TenantsBilling as Tenants Billing
    participant Reporting

    Note over RiskCatalog,RiskEvaluation: A cada publicação do catálogo
    RiskCatalog->>Kafka: RiskCatalogPublished (risk-catalog-published)
    Kafka->>RiskEvaluation: RiskCatalogPublished
    RiskEvaluation->>RiskCatalog: GET listagens v1 da versão publicada
    Note right of RiskEvaluation: Copia para CatalogSnapshots locais

    Note over Sensor,Ingestion: Coleta HTTP ou polling por assinatura de tenant
    Sensor->>Ingestion: Coleta (POST) ou resposta do polling
    Ingestion->>Geospatial: Operações geométricas v1 (HTTP)
    Note right of Ingestion: Coleta, amostras e outbox numa transação
    Ingestion->>Kafka: SensorEventDetected (disaster- / climatic-event-detected)
    Ingestion->>Kafka: TenantUsageEvent (tenant-usage-events)

    Kafka->>Geospatial: SensorEventDetected
    Note right of Geospatial: Indexa em geospatial-events
    Kafka->>RiskEvaluation: SensorEventDetected
    Note right of RiskEvaluation: Score com o snapshot local do catálogo
    RiskEvaluation->>Kafka: RiskUpdatedEvent (risk-updated), só com tenant e região do catálogo

    Kafka->>Orchestrator: RiskUpdatedEvent
    Note right of Orchestrator: Janela de alerta: quorum, cooldown, escalonamento
    Orchestrator->>Kafka: TriggerAlertCommand (alert-commands)
    Orchestrator->>Kafka: AlertTriggered (reporting-events) e uso (tenant-usage-events)

    Kafka->>Channels: TriggerAlertCommand
    Note right of Channels: Notificação alert:{janela}:{nível}, retry e fallback por canal
    Channels->>Kafka: NotificationSent / NotificationFailed (reporting-events)
    Channels->>Kafka: Uso por canal entregue (tenant-usage-events)

    Kafka->>TenantsBilling: TenantUsageEvent
    Kafka->>Reporting: ReportingEventEnvelope
